# Stack Generation

Detect stack components and generate corresponding rules.

## L4 Components

L4Components {
  Framework
  StateManagement
  Database
  TestRunner
  Deployment
  CICD
}

## Detection Process

detectOrAskL3L5() {
  (no source code) => askEcosystem |> recommendStack
  (source code exists) => analyzeStack |> presentFindings |> confirm
}

analyzeStack() {
  For each L4Component => detect from package files, config, imports
  Default StateManagement if app has state needs
}

## Stack Rule Generation

generateStackRules(confirmedStack) {
  For each technology in confirmedStack:
    Generate rules/stack/${tech}.mdc
    Calibrate to L1-L2 context
    Include framework-specific patterns
}

## Pattern Rule Generation

generatePatterns(stack) {
  Identify boilerplate for each L4Component:
    Framework => component pattern
    StateManagement => store pattern
    Database => model pattern
    Framework + API => api-route pattern

  For each pattern:
    Generate rules/patterns/${pattern}.mdc per @guidance/spec-driven-generation.mdc
    Generate commands/${pattern}.md
}

## Effects Rule Generation

generateEffectRules(stack) {
  (async operations in stack) => generate rules/effects.mdc

  EffectsPattern {
    call(fn, ...args) => yield { CALL: { fn, args } }
    put(action) => yield { PUT: action }
    Benefits => pure functions, testable via iterator.next(), observable
  }
}

Constraints {
  One stack rule per technology.
  Patterns derived from stack, not hardcoded.
  Calibrate strictness to lifecycle.
}
